1 0 0 1 58 661 Tm () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 638 Tm (There are times when life can feel so heavy that you stop asking, "What do I want to) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 623 Tm (create?" and start wondering, "How am I going to get through this?") Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 600 Tm (A business can collapse. Debt can build. Work, family responsibilities and uncertainty) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 585 Tm (can all press in at once. You may still show up for the people around you while privately) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 570 Tm (feeling frightened, isolated and defeated. You can start believing that the circumstances) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 555 Tm (around you have become the whole story-and that you have no power to change what comes) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 540 Tm (next.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 517 Tm (I know something about that feeling.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 494 Tm (When my business failed, and I fell deeply into debt, I felt like I had let down hundreds) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 479 Tm (of people, including my own family. The future I had imagined seemed to disappear. I) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 464 Tm (carried fear and disappointment, and I couldn't simply think my way to an easy answer.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 441 Tm (But even when we cannot choose every circumstance, we can begin to choose where we direct) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 426 Tm (our attention, what we practise, and what step we take next.) Tj
